  "content": "\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server/network/members\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server/blob/master/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinkedin.com%252fin%252fkit-lehto\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-LinkedIn-black.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=linkedin&colorB=555\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pbwnMwnUD6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1032138561618726952?logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge&label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbcss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/bcss?label=Modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"192\" height=\"28\"></a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>BlueMap 自訂皮膚伺服器</strong>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">簡單的 BlueMap 外掛程式，允許使用自訂皮膚伺服器。</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">技術棧</h3>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fabric api-DBD0B4?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/fabric language kotlin-7F52FF?style=for-the-badge&logo=kotlin&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ducky updater lib-1bd96a?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/bluemap-2c84e4?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">說明</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此外掛程式支援三種伺服器類型</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MOJANG_LIKE</strong> - 任何運作方式類似 Mojang API 的伺服器&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>CUSTOM</strong> - 任何其他可透過額外設定檔調整的自訂伺服器</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br>設定檔說明可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbcss\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/bluemap-custom-skin-server\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 查看</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.fstats.dev/timeline/39?mode=week\" width=\"1067\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">貢獻指南</h3>\n<p>正是您的貢獻讓開放原始碼社群成為一個學習、啟發與創造的美好地方。我們非常感謝您所做的任何貢獻。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您有改進建議，請複製（Fork）該倉庫並建立拉取請求（Pull Request）。您也可以直接開啟帶有「enhancement」標籤的議題。別忘了給專案按星標！再次感謝！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>複製（Fork）專案</li>\n<li>建立新功能分支 (<code>git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>提交您的更改 (<code>git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'</code>)</li>\n<li>推送至分支 (<code>git push origin feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>開啟拉取請求（Pull Request）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">授權條款</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本軟體依 MIT 授權條款釋出。更多資訊請參見 <strong><code>LICENSE.txt</code></strong></p>",
